* Lean bvA_one and bvA_eq_zero in one: for N <_ z1 every divisor d of N has weight mmu ( d ) (bvLam_eq_moebius), so ( ( z1 bvA z2 ) ` N ) = sum_ d | N mmu ( d ), which is 1 at N = 1 and 0 beyond (musum).

